WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.934
-Wow.
-All right.

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.569
-Wow.
-All right.

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.537
-So, here's how it works.

00:00:05.537 --> 00:00:06.773
In front of each of us

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:09.075
are two envelopes
containing confessions.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:11.878
One confession is true,
the other is a lie.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.279
Once you read your confession,

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:16.916
the other two players have
60 seconds to interrogate you.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:19.685
And they have to guess if you've
been lying or telling the truth.

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:21.587
John, you'll go first.

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:24.090
Pete, which envelope
should John open?

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.758
-Wait. Mine or his?
-His.

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:27.193
-Oh.
Number two.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:28.394
I don't know.
-Yeah, I know.

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:30.229
It doesn't really matter,
this part of it, yeah.

00:00:30.229 --> 00:00:31.997
Well, this could be the lie
or the truth, we don't know.

00:00:31.997 --> 00:00:33.532
-Cool.
-All right.

00:00:33.532 --> 00:00:34.734
-He's selling already.
Look at him.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.302
-Are we doing it correctly?
-Yes.

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.204
-Is this mine or his?
-No, this is his.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.906
-So what am I --
Who am I talking about, you?

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:42.375
-You're talking about you.
-Oh. All right.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.310
-Do you get it?
-Yeah, I should read the e-mail.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.278
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:49.148
-All right, gentlemen.

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:50.416
[ Clears throat ]

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:54.987
My neighbor was arrested
by the FBI for being a cannibal.

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:57.757
-What?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:01.127
Uh, okay, what year was this?
-2013.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:02.995
-So, cannibalism,
totally illegal at this point.

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:04.763
-So, wait --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.763 --> 00:01:07.033
Is this L.A.?
-New York.

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.801
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:11.003
-Oh, oh, wow, yeah.
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:12.505
That could actually happen.
Yeah, okay.

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.306
-The FBI got involved,
but how did you know?

00:01:14.306 --> 00:01:15.975
They knocked on --
They asked questions of you?

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:18.011
-When the FBI
was swarming our lobby

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:20.346
and arrested this guy
in a 6:00 a.m. raid.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.982
-Now, did you have any clue that
he was suspicious of anything?

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:25.585
-No, he never said to me
in the elevator, "Guess what."

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:26.585
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.585 --> 00:01:28.921
"I might be a cannibal."

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:30.989
-It's freaking me out,
because his voice is, like,

00:01:30.989 --> 00:01:32.825
what interrogation is.

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:34.059
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.059 --> 00:01:35.594
You're like, "I was there."
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:35.594 --> 00:01:37.397
-"I was there.
It was 6:00 a.m."

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:38.798
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.366
-A pre-dawn raid.
-Yeah.

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:42.368
-Did the guy ever act odd
at all?

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.304
-He was quiet.
-Yeah.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:46.039
-But he was so hungry.
-What was his name?

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.039
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:48.207
-I don't know his name.

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:49.809
-Oh, oh.
Interesting.

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:52.111
Didn't have a -- didn't have
a Nickname for him?

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:54.313
-No, it was a big building
in New York,

00:01:54.313 --> 00:01:55.314
so I didn't
have names for everyone.

00:01:55.314 --> 00:01:56.449
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.117
-I say no,
'cause if it was L.A.,

00:01:58.117 --> 00:01:59.285
I would buy it,
but I don't think

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:01.688
people are eating people here.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:03.656
-I think it's the opposite.
-You think it's the opposite?

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.824
-I think New York has got some
crazy, seedy stuff happening.

00:02:05.824 --> 00:02:08.027
-No, L.A. -- they'll cut
your head off here,

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.696
but out there,
they'll cut it off and eat it.

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:12.031
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:14.167
That's Hollywood.
-I know.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:16.202
What are you gonna say?
-I'm gonna say no.

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:18.170
I think it's false.
-I'm gonna say --

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.173
I'm gonna say, no, it's false.

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:21.741
-It's true.
-No!

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:23.008
-What?!

00:02:23.008 --> 00:02:26.078
What are you talking about?
-What?

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:27.413
-What?
-All right. All right.

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:28.548
-How did I not hear about this?

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:31.083
-Do you remember
the cannibal cop?

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:33.753
-What?
-Who remembers the cannibal cop?

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.054
-Yes, yes.
-You remember that story?

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:37.590
All right.
There was a cop, and he was --

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.592
He was online.
He was on message boards.

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:41.127
He's going,
"I'm gonna eat people.

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:43.295
I'm gonna kill and eat people."
And then other people would go,

00:02:43.295 --> 00:02:45.831
"I'm gonna kill people with you
and eat them, too," you know?

00:02:45.831 --> 00:02:48.067
-What messages boards
are you on?

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.569
[ Laughter ]
-I'm not on these, all right?

00:02:50.569 --> 00:02:53.305
My neighbors and friends are.
-Oh, okay.

00:02:53.305 --> 00:02:56.375
-So, our neighbor
was on a message board with him

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:57.877
and was planning to kidnap

00:02:57.877 --> 00:02:59.712
and eat someone
with the cannibal cop.

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:02.581
They did a sting operation
where an FBI agent

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:05.017
pretended to be
another interested cannibal

00:03:05.017 --> 00:03:07.486
who was also hungry for people.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.486 --> 00:03:09.955
And then he was like,
"Let's meet at 6:00 a.m.,

00:03:09.955 --> 00:03:11.524
and we'll go get someone
and eat 'em."

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:13.092
My neighbor goes, "Yes,"

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:14.960
