at 6:00 a.m.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.830
and arrests my neighbor,
and we have not spoken since.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.131
-Wow!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:22.201
Unbelievable.
Well done. Wow.

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:23.703
I thought
that one was out there.

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:24.737
-I mean, yeah.

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.172
-I thought that one
was out there.

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:27.273
-Yeah.
-I did not see that --

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:28.608
